494 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Joined as the sole product designer with no design system in place\073 scaled the design team from 1 to 12 designers through structured hiring\054 onboarding\054 and mentoring programmes\056\n\nArchitected Syntax\054 Phrase\047s shared design system \024 defining the full component library\054 design tokens\054 Figma file structure\054 accessibility standards \050WCAG\051\054 and contribution guidelines adopted across all product squads\056\n\nEstablished designer\023engineer collaboration workflow and design handoff practices\054 reducing rework and improving design\055to\055development velocity across multiple cross\055functional product teams\056\n\nMentored two product designers at a time\054 supporting their growth into senior individual contributor roles through structured critique sessions\054 written feedback\054 and career development planning\056\n\nAdvocated for dedicated engineering ownership of the design system\054 transitioning it from a spare\055time maintenance burden into funded product infrastructure \024 now a dependency for every Phrase product team\056\n\nMaintained product\055wide UI quality through regular design reviews\054 pattern standardisation\054 and documentation \024 ensuring interface consistency\054 interaction design coherence\054 and accessibility across the Phrase suite\056\n\nContributed to product strategy and roadmap decisions as the design voice in cross\055functional planning\054 aligning UI direction with business goals and user needs\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 495 0 R
     /Pg 480 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

