498 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Led product design for the merger of car2go and DriveNow into Share Now \024 a single unified mobile app and brand experience serving users across multiple European cities\056\n\nDesigned iOS and Android mobile UX flows centred on trust\054 familiarity\054 and clear orientation\054 enabling millions of existing users from two legacy brands to transition to the new product without friction\056\n\nDelivered end\055to\055end interaction design\054 information architecture\054 and high\055fidelity prototypes\073 collaborated closely with engineering and product management through an agile delivery process\056\n\nWorked across brand identity touchpoints and in\055app visual design to maintain coherence between the two merged product identities during a fast\055moving integration timeline\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 499 0 R
     /Pg 480 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

